pressed over his mouth.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_61","text":"And from now on, if you see us, you must pretend not to know us. We're always at risk of a Rapture fiend attack.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_62","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_62","text":"Hope nods even more vigorously, his mouth still covered by his hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_63","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_63","text":"Ark Ranger Black gently takes the trading card from between Hope's fingers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_64","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_64","text":"She takes out a pen and signs it. Hope's eyes widen, and his breathing turns ragged.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_65","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_65","text":"She hands the signed card back to him, which he accepts with trembling hands.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_66","text":"This is proof that we are now secretly partners.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_67","text":"If you ever spot a Rapture fiend somewhere,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_68","text":"hold this card up high and call for the Ark Rangers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_69","text":"We'll come running, no matter where you are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_70","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_70","text":"Hope's head bobs so frenetically that Ark Ranger Black briefly wonders if his neck might snap.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_71","text":"Good. Now off you go, partner.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_72","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_72","text":"Hope ducks down and quietly slips away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_73","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_73","text":"Back in his seat, he stares blankly into space, dumbfounded.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_74","text":"... Heh.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_75","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_75","text":"Ark Ranger Black smiles softly and takes a seat across from Red.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_76","text":"You could have at least given him an autograph.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_77","text":"It's exhausting. If I did that for every kid who asked, it'd be endless.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_78","text":"Children look to us and find courage.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_79","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_79","text":"Ark Ranger Red turns her head to look at Hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_80","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_80","text":"Hope meets her eyes, jumps in surprise, and frantically pretends not to notice, sipping his drink.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_81","text":"Give it two or three years, and he'll realize how foolish he was to buy into all this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_82","text":"Before long, he'll be calling us impostors without a second thought.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_83","text":"You haven't experienced that yet, have you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_84","text":"... No.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_85","text":"Haha. Well, then here's the thing. When it does, it completely shatters you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_86","text":"Red...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_87","text":"Don't get me wrong. I'm not doubting the validity of the work we do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_88","text":"I just came to terms with reality.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_89","text":"The reality that we're just heroes on-screen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_90","text":"Off-screen, we're ordinary Nikkes. Nothing more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_91","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_92","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_93","text":"I hope you never have to experience any of that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_94","text":"And even if you do, I hope you can brush it off and stand back up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_95","text":"I'll always have your back, so stay strong.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_96","text":"... Yeah. Thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_97","text":"Jeez, why does it feel so dour in here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["blue"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_98","text":"Blue.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_99","text":"About time you got here. Why are you always the last one to show?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_100","text":"Got held up signing a few autographs on the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_101","text":"Wow, get a load of the big celebrity. Oh, here's your blueberry soda.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_102","text":"Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_103","text":"So... what's with the solemn atmosphere? Did someone get into trouble again?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_104","text":"Don't look at me. My wild days are far behind me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_105","text":"Besides, we were having a perfectly civil and amiable conversation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_106","text":"Black. What's going on?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_107","text":"Don't just go around me and ask her instead!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_108","text":"It was nothing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_109","text":"Aww, now I feel left out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_110","text":"But you can make it up to me by letting me decide what's for lunch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_111","text":"... Absolutely not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_112","text":"Why not?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_113","text":"You'll just pick something weird again. What was it last time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_114","text":"A matcha, black, green tea latte protein shake.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_115","text":"Yeah, that. The one I can't even remember the name of. Darn thing left me bedridden for three days.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_116","text":"Oh come on, you both need to be more adventurous.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_117","text":"Okay, finish your drinks and let's go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_118","text":"*Sigh* Maybe we should call off these gatherings. We're not on some kind of exotic food adventure.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"black","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_119","text":"I have no complaints. Blue's recommendations have generally been okay. Nutritionally well-balanced as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"blue","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_120","text":"See? Black's the only one who gets it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_121","text":"... You both are off your rockers.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_arkranger1_01_s_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_arkranger1_01_s_122","text":"Like I always say, not everyone's cut out to be a hero.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}